e is cut short, however, and Dr Tali finds herself at the mercy of the machines!<br><br><br>Rescue the legendary Commanders and utilize their unique powers and abilities to help your cause! Only then will you stand a chance against the scourge of the Supremacy.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/864970/extras/98c5ce65b203db71d77202157fef0ac0.poster.avif?t=1728346417\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/864970/extras/98c5ce65b203db71d77202157fef0ac0.webm?t=1728346417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explosive Firepower and Utility Modules </h2>Discover and unlock an arsenal of heavy weapons, defensive utilities and doomsday devices as you save The human Colonies from the genocide of their rebellious AI! <br><br><br>From automatic phase blasters, flak cannons and high propulsion lasers, to heat-seeking rocket pods and destructive nuclear weaponry - The Alliance has everything they need to reach the Outer Rim!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/864970/extras/e4d1a9e36b437969b9dbf65816bc9624.poster.avif?t=1728346417\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/864970/extras/e4d1a9e36b437969b9dbf65816bc9624.webm?t=1728346417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/864970/extras/e4d1a9e36b437969b9dbf65816bc9624.mp4?t=1728346417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WORLDWIDE REVIEWS</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/864970/extras/d8a602edce4da757bf424568314ee5fd.avif?t=1728346417\" /></div><